# Newline-separated regexes for file paths to exclude from secret scanning.
# Consulted by the secret-scan job (full history, all detectors, unverified
# included) to silence known false positives.

# Connection-string placeholder examples (Password=..., Password=<secret>) in a
# deleted enterprise infra doc. SQLServer detector flags these as unverified.
^docs/aws\.md$

# The secret-scan walks full history across all branches. Exclude this allowlist
# file from its own scan so placeholder examples in these comments are not
# re-flagged by the URI detector.
^\.trufflehog-exclude$

# apk Basic-auth doc-comment placeholder (URL userinfo form) is not a credential.
# It lives in apk ecosystem commit history, which the full-history scan walks.
^src/Dependably\.Core/Api/ApkController\.cs$
^tests/Dependably\.Tests/Integration/ApkControllerTests\.cs$
